tion inputs can contain further resource references; consult their source schemas and the overview prerequisites. No ownership adoption is implied." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="625.00" width="2540.00" height="130.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
